ls on some of the group's most important tracks such as \"El Preso\" before also leaving to pursue a solo career.\r\n\r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:743174","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":false,"id":441768,"name":"Joe Arroyo"},{"active":true,"id":441769,"name":"Piper \"Pimienta\" Diaz"},{"active":true,"id":441770,"name":"Joseito Martinez"},{"active":true,"id":1501317,"name":"Julio Ernesto Estrada"},{"active":false,"id":1997209,"name":"Rodolfo Aicardi"},{"active":false,"id":2085102,"name":"Fabio Espinosa"},{"active":false,"id":2435453,"name":"Hernan Gutierrez"},{"active":true,"id":2437084,"name":"Rafael Benítez"},{"active":true,"id":2437088,"name":"Mariano Sepúlveda"},{"active":true,"id":2437089,"name":"Jesús Villegas"},{"active":false,"id":2771390,"name":"Gustavo Garcia (3)"},{"active":false,"id":3060138,"name":"German Carreño"},{"active":false,"id":3242481,"name":"Harold Peláez"},{"active":true,"id":4099851,"name":"Edulfamid Molina Díaz"},{"active":false,"id":15828206,"name":"Wilson \"Saoko\" Manyoma"}],"namevariations":["Fruco Y Sus Tesos","Fruko","Fruko El Bueno y Sus Tesos","Fruko Estrada Y Sus Tesos","Fruko Y Su Tesos","Fruko Y Sus Tesos","Fruko Y Sus Tesos (Canta Joe Arroyo)","Fruko Y Sus Tesos De La Salsa","Full Salsa"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/743174-Fruko-y-sus-Tesos","type":"artist","urls":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruko_y_sus_Tesos"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/8051290/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"8051290","image":"https://i.discogs.com/bWvE4tU6_MVcHhrwGI-jN44Kr_7vLEet2sHGEHmWoGQ/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:337/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTgwNTEy/OTAtMTYwNjgxODEy/NC03MjMwLmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/WSzxc2bWCkIfANE0jXGS1K4rys_zhXmA_PN4d6d1cT0/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTgwNTEy/OTAtMTYwNjgxODEy/NC03MjMwLmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"UK rapper, songwriter, hailing from Leicester","provider